  "header": "<header><div class=\"gl-nav\"><nav class=\"gl-nav-inner gl-desktop-nav\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a href=\"/\" aria-current=\"page\">Home</a><a href=\"/portfolio-2/\">Cinematography</a><a href=\"/portfolio/\">Photography</a><a href=\"/client-reviews/\">Reviews</a><a href=\"/experience-2/\">Experience</a><a href=\"/about-us/\">About Us</a><a href=\"/contact-us-2/\">Contact Us</a></nav><details class=\"gl-mobile-menu\"><summary>Menu</summary><nav aria-label=\"Mobile navigation\"><a href=\"/\" aria-current=\"page\">Home</a><a href=\"/portfolio-2/\">Cinematography</a><a href=\"/portfolio/\">Photography</a><a href=\"/client-reviews/\">Reviews</a><a href=\"/experience-2/\">Experience</a><a href=\"/about-us/\">About Us</a><a href=\"/contact-us-2/\">Contact Us</a></nav></details></div><div class=\"gl-masthead\"><img src=\"/assets/e845a4337da29ba0.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"411\" alt=\"GioLina — photography and cinematography\" fetchpriority=\"high\"><p>Cinematic wedding filmmaking &amp; photography</p><div class=\"gl-header-actions\"><nav class=\"gl-social-icons\" aria-label=\"Social media\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/GioLinaFilms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Instagram\"><span class=\"gl-social-glyph\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xf16d;</span></a><a href=\"https://vimeo.com/readytogoproductions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Vimeo\"><span class=\"gl-social-glyph\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xf40a;</span></a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/GioLinaFilms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Facebook\"><span class=\"gl-social-glyph\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xf39e;</span></a></nav><a class=\"gl-header-inquire\" href=\"/contact-us-2/\">Inquire about your day</a></div></div></header>",
  "content": "<section class=\"gl-hero\" aria-labelledby=\"gl-hero-heading\"><div class=\"gl-hero-video\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><iframe title=\"GioLina wedding film background\" src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/548643452?background=1&amp;autoplay=1&amp;muted=1&amp;loop=1\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\" tabindex=\"-1\"></iframe></div><div class=\"gl-hero-copy\"><p class=\"gl-eyebrow\">Revisit your most beautiful moments</p><h1 id=\"gl-hero-heading\"><span>Wedding films</span><span>for your timeless story</span></h1><p class=\"gl-hero-sub\">Beautifully captured. Deeply felt.</p><a class=\"gl-button gl-button-light\" href=\"/contact-us-2/\">Inquire</a></div></section>\n<section class=\"gl-section gl-intro\"><div class=\"gl-intro-copy\"><p class=\"gl-eyebrow\">The moments that stay with you</p><h2>True emotion.<br>A story that's yours.</h2><p>We distill both the physical beauty and the intangible emotion of our couples’ weddings into one stunning film.</p><p>Every film should be a dream you can revisit — bringing you back to the people, the feeling, and the moments that made your day.</p><a class=\"gl-text-link\" href=\"/portfolio-2/\">View the films</a></div><div class=\"gl-pair\"><figure><img src=\"/assets/d5c736b9d423634c.png\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1800\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"A couple sharing a quiet kiss in silhouette\"></figure><figure><img src=\"/assets/9d28de469d3f3c6b.jpg\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Black and white wedding portrait of a bride and groom\"></figure></div></section>\n<figure class=\"gl-ballroom\"><img src=\"/assets/cb99e1db42a51c75.jpg\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"A bride and groom sharing a dip and kiss beneath a domed ballroom ceiling\"><figcaption>A day to remember</figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"gl-detail-pair\"><figure><img src=\"/assets/86fefc441f2855ba.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"1066\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"A close view of a couple holding hands on their wedding day\"></figure><figure><img src=\"/assets/59a82fb328e9184c.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"1067\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"A bride and groom together beneath a veil\"></figure></div>\n<section class=\"gl-feature\"><div class=\"gl-feature-inner\"><figure class=\"gl-film-poster\"><img src=\"/assets/690ef6c3e99444cd.png\" width=\"617\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Bianca and Bobby on their wedding day\"><button type=\"button\" data-vimeo-id=\"328842441\" data-film-title=\"Bianca &amp; Bobby\"><span>Play film</span></button></figure><div><p class=\"gl-eyebrow\">New York City, New York</p><h2>Bianca &amp; Bobby</h2><a class=\"gl-text-link\" href=\"/portfolio-2/\">Explore our cinematography</a></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"gl-home-stories\" aria-labelledby=\"gl-stories-title\"><h2 id=\"gl-stories-title\">In motion. In a moment.</h2><div class=\"gl-story-grid\"><article><div class=\"gl-film-preview\"><iframe src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/548643452?muted=1&amp;title=0&amp;byline=0&amp;portrait=0&amp;dnt=1\" title=\"GioLina wedding film preview\" loading=\"lazy\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></iframe><button type=\"button\" data-vimeo-id=\"548643452\" data-film-title=\"GioLina wedding film\"><span>Play film</span></button></div><h3>Cinematography</h3><p>Revisit the voices, the movement, and the feeling of your day.</p><a class=\"gl-text-link\" href=\"/portfolio-2/\">View the films</a></article><article><figure><img src=\"/assets/7353475231731939.jpg\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"A wedding couple together beside the waterfront\"></figure><h3>Photography</h3><p>The quiet glances and beautiful moments, held in a photograph.</p><a class=\"gl-text-link\" href=\"/portfolio/\">Explore the photographs</a></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"gl-section gl-review\"><div class=\"gl-review-video-slot\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Vimeo promo placeholder for Alexandria\"><span class=\"gl-review-video-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">▷</span><span>Alexandria’s wedding film</span><small>Vimeo promo coming soon</small></div><div><h2>From our clients</h2><blockquote><p>Frank was our wedding videographer in August 2024 and did an incredible job. From the start, it was clear how much he cares about his work, he put so much time and attention into every detail, from choosing the perfect music to spending time on long calls with us. He delivered our video incredibly quickly, and it was absolutely breathtaking, perfectly capturing every moment and emotion of the day. Frank is truly passionate about what he does, and it shows in his work. We can’t recommend him enough!</p><cite>Alexandria P</cite></blockquote><a class=\"gl-text-link\" href=\"/client-reviews/\">More reviews</a></div></section>\n<section class=\"gl-section gl-experience\"><div><p class=\"gl-eyebrow\">The GioLina Films experience</p><h2>Be present.<br>We'll capture the feeling.</h2><p>Our relaxed approach puts you at ease, so you can be yourself and enjoy your wedding day in front of our cameras.</p><a class=\"gl-text-link\" href=\"/experience-2/\">Discover the experience</a></div><figure><img src=\"/assets/e941428ca2af1172.jpeg\" width=\"1707\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"A bride looking toward her partner during their ceremony\"></figure></section>\n<section class=\"gl-about\"><div class=\"gl-about-inner\"><div class=\"gl-recognition\" aria-label=\"Wedding platforms\"><img src=\"/assets/228946ec584cbe8d.jpg\" width=\"1024\" height=\"535\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"The Knot\"><img src=\"/assets/41b1a2dbc44d0e67.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"256\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"WeddingWire\"></div><div><p class=\"gl-eyebrow\">Behind the lens</p><h2>We are GioLina Films.</h2><p>We created GioLina Films to transform the magical memories from a couple’s wedding into a visual story that showcases their love for a lifetime.</p><a class=\"gl-text-link\" href=\"/about-us-2/\">Get to know us</a></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"gl-closing\"><figure><img src=\"/assets/2487c01449acd020.jpg\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"A newly married couple kissing on a city street\"></figure><div><h2>Let's create<br>something beautiful.</h2><a class=\"gl-button\" href=\"/contact-us-2/\">Inquire</a></div></section>",
